  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This is mainly for people who use smooth turning in VR, although it should apply to desktop turning as well, maybe also a \"turn degrees per click\" for snap turning would go well with this.\nAfter seeing this feature in a certain different VR application and finding it to be extremely useful, I started wondering why doesn't VRChat have this, it feels like it would be easy to implement, just a slider in the UI that corresponds to the float value of player turn speed.\nWhen doing more intense activity like dancing I prefer a higher turn speed, when laying down and talking I prefer a slower turn speed, being able to control this on the fly is actually really useful.",
